      <Heading>XForward</Heading>							Options are XForward, XSide, YForward, YSide
      <Measure>Width</Measure>								Options are Width and Length and is used for roadblock measurement system
	  <Separation>0.5</Separation>							Width/Length of model plus this separation amount
    </Prop>
-->
